<title>NETHERLANDS: Vendex details 96/97 operating profits.</title>
<headline>Vendex details 96/97 operating profits.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail and business services group Vendex International NV gave the following breakdown of its sales and operating profits for the full year 1996/97</p>
<p>(all figures in millions of guilders):</p>
<p>			     SALES	     OP PROFIT     REAL ESTATE</p>
<p>Food		  4,770 vs  4,615	124 vs 102	 7 vs  18</p>
<p>Department stores 1,711 vs  1,643	136 vs  82	80 vs  50</p>
<p>Specialty stores  1,697 vs  1,501	 92 vs  88	18 vs  39</p>
<p>TOTAL RETAIL	8,178 vs  7,759	352 vs 272     105 vs 107</p>
<p>Temporary work    2,236 vs  1,930	 75 vs  64     nil vs   1</p>
<p>Maintenance	 1,437 vs  1,268	 42 vs  41     nil vs   1</p>
<p>Miscellaneous	 171 vs    153	 12 vs  10     nil vs nil</p>
<p>TOTAL SERVICES    3,844 vs  3,351	129 vs 115     nil vs   2</p>
<p>OTHER ACTIVITIES    123 vs    147   loss 8 vs  25 pft   6 vs  17</p>
<p>OVERALL TOTAL    12,145 vs 11,257	473 vs 412     111 vs 126</p>
<p>NOTES - Real estate column shows contribution to operating profit made by sale and redevelopment of real estate.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
